      "title": "Login",
      "description": "Login | Manchester Metropolitan University Careers CareerZone Open toolbar Accessibility Grayscale High contrast Negative contrast Light background Links underline Readable font Reset Explore vacancies Working at Manchester Met Living in Manchester How to apply Professorial opportunities Login Explore vacancies Working at Manchester Met Living in Manchester How to apply Professorial opportunities Login Login Sign In/Register Use one of the buttons below to sign in or create a new account. Alternatively, you can use your email address to get started. Or Email * Next Sign In Enter your password below to sign in. Email Password * Back Sign In Back Forgotten your password? Forgotten your password? Register with Email Fill out the form below to create an account with us. Username * Username * Password * Your password must contain at least one letter. First name * Last name * I hereby consent to MMU collecting, storing and processing my data in accordance with the privacy policy . I understand that I may withdraw my consent or update my details at any time. I agree * Back Register Back Loading Start at the next stage of your career Find out more about our opportunities, or get in touch to discuss bringing your expertise to a university where you'll be supported and valued. Explore our vacancies Get in touch Get in touch Manchester Metropolitan University All Saints Building Manchester M15 6BH United Kingdom ManMetJobs@mmu.ac.uk +44 (0)161 247 6820 Facebook icon Manchester Metropolitan University on Facebook Twitter icon Manchester Metropolitan University on Twitter YouTube icon Manchester Metropolitan University on YouTube LinkedIn icon Manchester Metropolitan University on LinkedIn Instagram icon Manchester Metropolitan University on Instagram Explore vacancies Working at Manchester Met Living in Manchester How to apply About us Search Get in touch Policies, regulations and legal notices Cookies Website terms of use Accessibility Freedom of information Governance of the University Modern slavery © 2026 Manchester Metropolitan University, all rights reserved. Cookie Preferences This site uses cookies and other tracking technologies to improve your browsing experience, show personalised content/ads and analyse site traffic. Select cookies to accept Required cookies These cookies are used to ensure the user has a secure journey through the site. earcusessionid - Used to maintain your session. earcusession - Used to secure your session. earcucc - Used to manage your cookie preferences. Analytics Cookies Analytics cookies or performance cookies are used to track website visitors and their user behaviour. _ga - Used by Google Analytics. _gid - Used by Google Analytics. _gat - Used by Google Analytics. _fbp - Used by Meta (Facebook) Pixel. Accept Cookies Accept All Cookies Customise Cookies Reject All Optional"
